- Add visual indicator in ChatMiniMap marks showing if current user has read the message
- Use FontAwesome `fa-check-double` icon with conditional coloring (green/gray)
- Update mark data to include read status
- Modify mark rendering to show the icon overlay

**Dependencies & Risks:**
- The `read_by` field exists in the Message model but we need to check current user
- The mark should only show for assistant messages (makes sense)
- No backend changes needed - just UI enhancement

**Target Files:**
- `src/components/chat/ChatMiniMap.vue` (main changes)
- Possibly `src/components/ChatEntry.vue` (to verify read tracking is working)

