## Summary

The ChatMiniMap now displays a **double-check icon (✓✓)** on assistant messages:
- **Green color** (`text-success`) when the message has been seen by the current user
- **Gray color** (`text-base-300`) when the message hasn't been seen yet

The icon appears as an overlay in the center of each assistant message mark in the mini-map. Hovering over a mark shows the tooltip with `[seen]` or `[unseen]` status.

**Note:** The `read_by` tracking was already implemented in `ChatEntry.vue` via the `markMessageAsSeen()` and `submitMessageSeen()` methods, so no changes were needed there. The backend API (`markMessageAsSeen`) is being called when messages become visible to the user.

